    "detailed_description": "<strong>CONQUER THE CREATORS</strong><br>You're Cage, an underdog streamer, teetering on the brink of obscurity.  Seize a mysterious invitation to stream <strong>WISH</strong>, an unexplored MMO, and buckle up for the ride of your life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/aa39fac82c18ab25cd358c0b1990c99c.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/aa39fac82c18ab25cd358c0b1990c99c.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/aa39fac82c18ab25cd358c0b1990c99c.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tactical auto-battler RPG plus Streamer simulator all in one!<br></li><li> You've never experienced a story like this<br></li><li> Recruit adventurers with the LFG Party System<br></li><li> Unlock powerful combat abilities by creating Formations<br></li><li> Watch in horror as your in-game choices bleed into the real world!<br></li><li> 25+ endings<br></li><li> Fully voiced</li></ul><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/b5dfdd61ca9f953ba4d1045c4cbeaecc.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/b5dfdd61ca9f953ba4d1045c4cbeaecc.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/b5dfdd61ca9f953ba4d1045c4cbeaecc.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>FORGE YOUR STREAMING PERSONA</strong> <br>Inspired by the Persona series and with an innovative RPG auto-battle system, every choice you make shapes your path.  Will you be a family-friendly entertainer or a controversial edgelord?   Each decision impacts your journey and your audience.   Balance is key; keep your energy high, stress low, and sanity in check to dazzle your audience stream after stream.<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/03fecb57990e3a5eda562edad5219ccf.avif?t=1734354521\" /></span><br><br><strong>MASTER THE MMO, MASTER YOUR FATE</strong><br>As Cage, dive into <strong>WISH</strong> and lead massive raids through a rich, expansive world brimming with quests, mystical artifacts, and treacherous dungeons.  Watch your subscriber count soar as you become a streaming legend.<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/9ea84feb637d51b2ae5c57bd5e9d701b.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/9ea84feb637d51b2ae5c57bd5e9d701b.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/9ea84feb637d51b2ae5c57bd5e9d701b.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UNRAVEL FANTASTIC MYSTERIES</strong><br>Uncover the enigmatic lore of the Monumentals, gargantuan beings consuming cities, and the Whisperers, mysterious figures holding the balance. Your streaming journey intertwines with these mysteries, leading to unexpected revelations.<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/320ce489054abea9c918de5e80c9f8c2.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/320ce489054abea9c918de5e80c9f8c2.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/320ce489054abea9c918de5e80c9f8c2.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A STREAMER'S DILEMMA</strong><br>Who Influences the Influencers?  As you skyrocket to fame and fortune, a lingering question haunts every stream \u2013 who really controls the world of <strong>WISH</strong>, and what's their game?<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/c42bd7dd1f9e7cad3fd3410fc1421435.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/c42bd7dd1f9e7cad3fd3410fc1421435.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/c42bd7dd1f9e7cad3fd3410fc1421435.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>READY FOR THE SPOTLIGHT?</strong><br><strong>Join Cage's exhilarating quest to become a streaming superstar in <strong>WISH</strong>.  Make choices, build your legacy, and unveil hidden truths.  Your streaming empire awaits!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/78f5cd213666b22208f46da46ea65bd6.avif?t=1734354521\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>CONQUER THE CREATORS</strong><br>You're Cage, an underdog streamer, teetering on the brink of obscurity.  Seize a mysterious invitation to stream <strong>WISH</strong>, an unexplored MMO, and buckle up for the ride of your life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/aa39fac82c18ab25cd358c0b1990c99c.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/aa39fac82c18ab25cd358c0b1990c99c.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/aa39fac82c18ab25cd358c0b1990c99c.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tactical auto-battler RPG plus Streamer simulator all in one!<br></li><li> You've never experienced a story like this<br></li><li> Recruit adventurers with the LFG Party System<br></li><li> Unlock powerful combat abilities by creating Formations<br></li><li> Watch in horror as your in-game choices bleed into the real world!<br></li><li> 25+ endings<br></li><li> Fully voiced</li></ul><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/b5dfdd61ca9f953ba4d1045c4cbeaecc.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/b5dfdd61ca9f953ba4d1045c4cbeaecc.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/b5dfdd61ca9f953ba4d1045c4cbeaecc.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>FORGE YOUR STREAMING PERSONA</strong> <br>Inspired by the Persona series and with an innovative RPG auto-battle system, every choice you make shapes your path.  Will you be a family-friendly entertainer or a controversial edgelord?   Each decision impacts your journey and your audience.   Balance is key; keep your energy high, stress low, and sanity in check to dazzle your audience stream after stream.<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/03fecb57990e3a5eda562edad5219ccf.avif?t=1734354521\" /></span><br><br><strong>MASTER THE MMO, MASTER YOUR FATE</strong><br>As Cage, dive into <strong>WISH</strong> and lead massive raids through a rich, expansive world brimming with quests, mystical artifacts, and treacherous dungeons.  Watch your subscriber count soar as you become a streaming legend.<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/9ea84feb637d51b2ae5c57bd5e9d701b.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/9ea84feb637d51b2ae5c57bd5e9d701b.webm?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/9ea84feb637d51b2ae5c57bd5e9d701b.mp4?t=1734354521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UNRAVEL FANTASTIC MYSTERIES</strong><br>Uncover the enigmatic lore of the Monumentals, gargantuan beings consuming cities, and the Whisperers, mysterious figures holding the balance. Your streaming journey intertwines with these mysteries, leading to unexpected revelations.<br><br>       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530160/extras/320ce489054abea9c918de5e80c9f8c2.poster.avif?t=1734354521\" ><source src=\"https://s